From 8aa92e36d0d43281b3d3a0645c9c5a517538642a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:22:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] The program's 3D options are the contract's: enable 3D
 and the shortcut to Display Settings

Remove --stereo-eye-angle (the separation is the desktop's), let render.stereo be
switched on and off while the window runs (F3), add the display_settings command (F4,
kcmshell6 kcm_kscreen), tell in the ten languages of the edition when the display
offers no stereo window, and add window::isStereo.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
